\details{
The user inputs for this module are separated from the outputs to
allow for more flexible UI design.

This module wraps \code{\link[GOfan:sunburstGO]{GOfan::sunburstGO()}} to draw a Gene Ontology (GO)
enrichment \strong{sunburst} ("fan") plot: the GO directed acyclic graph is
converted into a circular layout where each ring is a hierarchy level and each
segment is a GO term. The figure is rendered with \code{plotBy = "plotly"} so it is
interactive (hover to read labels, click a segment to zoom into its
offspring).

The input data are inspected to pick sensible defaults: the GO-ID column, the
ontology category (from a \code{ONTOLOGY} column when present), a numeric fill
column (preferring \code{qvalue}), and an optional proportional sub-rectangle
column (preferring \code{Count}).
